      "content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#f7f5ef\">\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"ALLone — real people, meaningful conversations, no judgment.\">\n  <title>ALLone — You are not alone</title>\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"app-shell\">\n    <aside class=\"sidebar\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\">\n      <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#home\" aria-label=\"ALLone home\"><span class=\"brand-mark\">a<span>+</span></span><span>ALL<span class=\"brand-one\">one</span></span></a>\n      <div class=\"side-label\">YOUR SPACE</div>\n      <nav class=\"side-nav\">\n        <button class=\"nav-link active\" data-view=\"home\"><span class=\"nav-icon\">⌂</span> Home</button>\n        <button class=\"nav-link\" data-view=\"conversations\"><span class=\"nav-icon\">◌</span> Conversations <span class=\"nav-count\">1</span></button>\n        <button class=\"nav-link\" data-view=\"community\"><span class=\"nav-icon\">♡</span> Community</button>\n      </nav>\n      <div class=\"side-label support-label\">TAKE A BREATH</div>\n      <div class=\"sidebar-note\"><span class=\"note-spark\">✳</span><p>You don't have to have the right words. Just showing up is enough.</p><span class=\"note-by\">A LITTLE REMINDER</span></div>\n      <button class=\"nav-link safety-link\" id=\"safetyLink\"><span class=\"nav-icon\">♡</span> Safety & support</button>\n      <div class=\"profile\"><div class=\"avatar avatar-you\">J</div><div><strong>Jamie</strong><span>Here for connection</span></div><button class=\"more-button\" aria-label=\"Profile options\">···</button></div>\n    </aside>\n\n    <main class=\"main-area\" id=\"home\">\n      <header class=\"topbar\"><button class=\"mobile-brand\" aria-label=\"ALLone home\">ALL<span>one</span></button><div class=\"topbar-spacer\"></div><button class=\"icon-button notification-button\" aria-label=\"Notifications\">♧<i></i></button><button class=\"top-avatar\" aria-label=\"Your profile\">J</button></header>\n      <div class=\"demo-banner\"><span class=\"demo-dot\"></span> Preview mode <span>·</span> This is a demo. No real conversations are connected yet.</div>\n\n      <section class=\"greeting-row\">\n        <div><p class=\"eyebrow\" id=\"greetingDate\">A SPACE FOR YOU</p><h1 id=\"welcomeHeading\">Good morning, Jamie <span class=\"wave\">✳</span></h1><p class=\"subheading\" id=\"welcomeSubheading\">Whatever brought you here, we're glad you did.</p></div>\n        <button class=\"quiet-button\" id=\"checkInButton\"><span>＋</span> Daily check-in</button>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"role-card\" aria-label=\"Choose your role\">\n        <div class=\"role-copy\"><span class=\"role-label\">HOW WOULD YOU LIKE TO SHOW UP?</span><h2>You can be both.</h2><p>Some days you need a listener. Some days you are one.</p></div>\n        <div class=\"role-switch\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Choose Speaker or Listener mode\"><button class=\"role-option selected\" data-role=\"speaker\"><span class=\"role-emoji\">☁</span><span><strong>I need to talk</strong><small>Find a listener</small></span><span class=\"role-check\">✓</span></button><button class=\"role-option\" data-role=\"listener\"><span class=\"role-emoji listener-emoji\">♡</span><span><strong>I'm here to listen</strong><small>Be there for someone</small></span><span class=\"role-check\">✓</span></button></div>\n      </section>\n\n      <div class=\"content-grid\">\n        <section class=\"discover-section\">\n          <div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\" id=\"listEyebrow\">A GOOD PLACE TO START</p><h2 id=\"listHeading\">Listeners here for you</h2></div><button class=\"text-button\" id=\"seeAllButton\">See all <span>→</span></button></div>\n          <div class=\"filter-row\" aria-label=\"Filter listeners\"><button class=\"filter-chip active\" data-filter=\"all\">✳ Recommended</button><button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"available\">Available now</button><button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"language\">My languages</button></div>\n          <div class=\"people-list\" id=\"peopleList\">\n            <article class=\"person-card\" data-name=\"Amara\" data-available=\"true\" data-languages=\"English, French\"><div class=\"person-avatar avatar-coral\">A<span class=\"online-dot\"></span></div><div class=\"person-info\"><div class=\"person-name-row\"><h3>Amara <span class=\"verified\">✳</span></h3><span class=\"availability\"><i></i> Here now</span></div><p class=\"person-bio\">Good at holding space for the messy, complicated stuff.</p><div class=\"person-tags\"><span>English</span><span>French</span><span class=\"topic-tag\">Life changes</span></div></div><button class=\"connect-button\" data-person=\"Amara\">Say hello <span>→</span></button></article>\n            <article class=\"person-card\" data-name=\"Mateo\" data-available=\"true\" data-languages=\"English, Spanish\"><div class=\"person-avatar avatar-blue\">M<span class=\"online-dot\"></span></div><div class=\"person-info\"><div class=\"person-name-row\"><h3>Mateo <span class=\"verified\">✳</span></h3><span class=\"availability\"><i></i> Here now</span></div><p class=\"person-bio\">I believe being heard can make all the difference.</p><div class=\"person-tags\"><span>English</span><span>Spanish</span><span class=\"topic-tag\">Stress & worry</span></div></div><button class=\"connect-button\" data-person=\"Mateo\">Say hello <span>→</span></button></article>\n            <article class=\"person-card\" data-name=\"Priya\" data-available=\"false\" data-languages=\"English, Hindi\"><div class=\"person-avatar avatar-yellow\">P</div><div class=\"person-info\"><div class=\"person-name-row\"><h3>Priya <span class=\"verified\">✳</span></h3><span class=\"availability away\"><i></i> Back later</span></div><p class=\"person-bio\">Here to listen without trying to fix everything.</p><div class=\"person-tags\"><span>English</span><span>Hindi</span><span class=\"topic-tag\">Feeling stuck</span></div></div><button class=\"connect-button secondary-connect\" data-person=\"Priya\">View profile <span>→</span></button></article>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"empty-state\" id=\"emptyState\" hidden><span>☁</span><h3>No one by that filter just now</h3><p>Try another filter. There's no rush.</p></div>\n          <div class=\"no-pressure\"><span>♡</span><p>Not sure what to say? <button id=\"promptButton\">Start with a prompt</button></p></div>\n        </section>\n\n        <aside class=\"right-column\">\n          <section class=\"gentle-card\"><div class=\"gentle-art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"art-sun\"></span><span class=\"art-hill hill-one\"></span><span class=\"art-hill hill-two\"></span><span class=\"art-star\">✳</span></div><div class=\"gentle-content\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">A GENTLE REMINDER</p><h2>You don't have to<br>go through it alone.</h2><p>A real conversation can start with one small hello.</p><button id=\"findListenerButton\">Find a listener <span>→</span></button></div></section>\n          <section class=\"community-card\"><div class=\"community-icon\">♡</div><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">A LITTLE MORE HUMAN</p><h3>Small moments matter</h3><p>Read kind words from people who get it.</p><button id=\"communityButton\">Visit community <span>→</span></button></div></section>\n          <section class=\"safety-note\"><span class=\"safety-icon\">ⓘ</span><p>ALLone offers peer connection, not professional or emergency care. <button id=\"safetyInline\">Learn about support</button></p></section>\n        </aside>\n      </div>\n      <footer class=\"footer\"><span>ALLone <b>·</b> You are not alone. We are ALLone.</span><div><button id=\"footerSafety\">Your safety</button><button id=\"footerAbout\">Our promise</button></div></footer>\n    </main>\n  </div>\n\n  <nav class=\"mobile-nav\" aria-label=\"Mobile navigation\"><button class=\"mobile-nav-item active\" data-view=\"home\"><span>⌂</span>Home</button><button class=\"mobile-nav-item\" data-view=\"conversations\"><span>◌</span>Chats</button><button class=\"mobile-nav-item\" data-view=\"community\"><span>♡</span>Community</button><button class=\"mobile-nav-item\" id=\"mobileProfile\"><span class=\"mobile-mini-avatar\">J</span>You</button></nav>\n\n  <dialog class=\"app-dialog\" id=\"appDialog\" aria-labelledby=\"dialogTitle\"><button class=\"dialog-close\" id=\"dialogClose\" aria-label=\"Close dialog\">×</button><div class=\"dialog-icon\" id=\"dialogIcon\">♡</div><p class=\"eyebrow\" id=\"dialogEyebrow\">A MOMENT FOR YOU</p><h2 id=\"dialogTitle\">Start wherever you are.</h2><div class=\"dialog-body\" id=\"dialogBody\"></div><div class=\"dialog-actions\" id=\"dialogActions\"></div></dialog>\n  <div class=\"toast\" id=\"toast\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n  <script src=\"app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
