      "content": "# ALLone\n\nA mobile-first frontend prototype for ALLone, a peer-support and human-connection platform.\n\n## Run\n\nOpen `index.html` directly in a browser. No build step is required.\n\nThe prototype includes responsive desktop/mobile layouts, Speaker and Listener switching, listener filters, conversation prompts, daily check-in, safety messaging, and demo dialogs.\n\nThis is a static preview only. It does not provide real matching, chat, authentication, moderation, or backend services.\n",
